Help on SIGs message reading

  RETURN     to go to the next message
  Backspace  (the <- key) to go to the previous message
  CTRL-A     to see the message again
  CTRL-P     to see the parent of the current message
  CTRL-C     to see the children (replies to) the current message

  first      to go to the first message in the SIG
  last       to go to the last (most recent) message in the SIG
  high       to go to the most recent message (high water) you
             have read in the SIG

  CTRL-R     to reply to the current message
  CTRL-E     to enter a new message

  CTRL-F     threaded read forward (goto next reply to same posting)
  CTRL-B     threaded read backward (goto previous reply)

  sub        to enter the subscription menu
  next       to goto the next SIG
  prev       to goto the previous SIG
  goto       to goto a SIG by name

